WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:16.096
Oh! Hello!

2
00:00:16.097 --> 00:00:19.776
Who are you?

3
00:00:19.777 --> 00:00:22.566
I'm a grasshopper.

4
00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:30.027
We are insects that jump!

5
00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:32.218
Where do you live?

6
00:00:32.219 --> 00:00:36.003
We live all over the world.

7
00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:40.485
We like forests and fields.

8
00:00:40.486 --> 00:00:43.306
What do you eat?

9
00:00:43.307 --> 00:00:46.891
Grasshoppers eat plants.

10
00:00:46.892 --> 00:00:50.626
We eat lots of leaves.

11
00:00:50.627 --> 00:00:54.320
We like bark and flowers too.

12
00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:57.667
You have really long legs!

13
00:00:57.668 --> 00:01:01.575
Our long back legs help us jump.

14
00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:06.812
We can jump very high and very far.

15
00:01:06.813 --> 00:01:09.853
Can you fly?

16
00:01:09.854 --> 00:01:16.400
Most grasshoppers have wings and can fly.

17
00:01:16.401 --> 00:01:20.811
Our legs help us spring into the air.

18
00:01:20.812 --> 00:01:24.063
Do you have any enemies?

19
00:01:24.064 --> 00:01:27.498
Many animals like to eat us.

20
00:01:27.499 --> 00:01:30.290
But our colors help us hide.

21
00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:33.855
We can hop away fast too!

22
00:01:33.856 --> 00:01:36.656
Do you live alone?

23
00:01:36.657 --> 00:01:39.736
Grasshoppers usually live alone.

24
00:01:39.737 --> 00:01:44.559
But sometimes we gather in big groups.

25
00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.647
I see some fresh grass.

26
00:01:47.648 --> 00:01:51.264
I'm going to jump over there.

27
00:01:51.265 --> 00:01:56.141
Good-bye, Grasshopper!
